      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这样的恐惧，只要目白多伯持续挑战，\n受到周遭期待就必定会出现。\n换个角度想，也能帮助自己成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdaab8c9cfac7846075b1c397e10e2bafbd8f96f0091aa789331beae2b976cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
