      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "颤抖跟恐惧没有就此消失。即使如此，\n为了那些对自己有所期待的人，\n她还是想跑完“橡树大赛”……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70506819099533b8304dd39aed19a0f4b1fdcd4a3996bcea8b0000043d63318e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
