      "uid": "zhcn:8041bfd14c0b4ac05c2c43e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结束三后冠的挑战后，\n目白多伯决定将下一个目标\n设在“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f3b5f7b8e840781cecea48f2113a83cc454f4550e9fec8bcb24284b71ee429",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
