    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f5c64192aa4d7585be69bce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对目白多伯来说，无论距离长度还是\n参赛者们的强度，势必将被迫陷入一场苦战。\n但应该能成为她往后面对挑战的养分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5e301fe88c381bbb70564f74f35b01540e6ac9ef1867819a055484a6dc4553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
