      "uid": "zhcn:b16e8ee200752cf0a847bf4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯不但没有畏缩，\n反而很开心能跟憧憬的前辈气槽同场竞争，\n对于正式比赛充满了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af9411fbd8c9025272eb39621c0cde90e7534a732f60c0abeb9688cee319e9e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
